      "text": "A whistleblower's email exposed a major leak of the NEET-UG medical entrance exam, with the provided PDF file closely matching the actual chemistry and biology tests. The national examination authority, upon receiving the evidence, acted to cancel the tainted results and transferred the case to the central investigation agency for a full probe. This led to the arrest of thirteen individuals, including a tutor, and the scheduling of a new test for June 21st, aiming to restore fairness for all the students affected by this breach of trust.",
