      "text": "The integrity of a nationwide medical exam was compromised when a tip-off revealed that test content had been leaked in advance. The examination management institution moved quickly to nullify the compromised scores and handed over the investigation to the central authorities. As a result, multiple people were arrested, and a re-examination was arranged for the following month, putting countless students through the stress and preparation once again.",
